                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Scoreboard on top, last trick at the bottom. The scoreboard button in the top bar closes and opens it; closed, the stage takes the full width and the LAST TRICK link returns to the felt's corner. With 6 to 8 pirates it switches to compact rows and round points, with a button to the full scoreboard.",
